# Allowlist: the image build (Dockerfile) needs the prebuilt binaries, the docs
# tree for the dashboard viewer, and the license files a redistribution has to
# carry. Everything else — node_modules, local data dirs, the onnx runtime tgz —
# stays out of the build context. The generated digest is re-excluded after the
# docs allowlist (later lines win) so it never enters the image.
*
!dist/
!docs/
docs/team-digest.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
